  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Lineare Funktionen im Vergleich</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Ein Elternteil &uuml;berlegt, welches Auto langfristig g&uuml;nstiger ist. Die Gesamtkosten (Kauf + Betrieb) lassen sich als lineare Funktion darstellen &ndash; mit x = gefahrene Kilometer.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Verbrenner:</strong> Anschaffung 5.000 &euro; + 20 ct pro km<br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>f(x) = 0,20 &middot; x + 5000</span><br><strong>E-Auto:</strong> Anschaffung 10.000 &euro; + 10 ct pro km<br><span style='font-family:monospace;'>g(x) = 0,10 &middot; x + 10000</span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe a) &ndash; Wertetabelle erg&auml;nzen</div><div class='tbl-wrap'><table><thead><tr><th style='background:#16a34a;'>Kilometer x</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>0</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>20.000</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>50.000</th><th style='background:#16a34a;'>80.000</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='row-label'>Verbrenner f(x) in &euro;</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='5000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='9000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='15000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='21000' placeholder='?'></td></tr><tr><td class='row-label'>E-Auto g(x) in &euro;</td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='10000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='12000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='15000' placeholder='?'></td><td><input class='cell-input' data-ans='18000' placeholder='?'></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe b) &ndash; Graphen einzeichnen</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px;'>Zeichne beide Geraden in das Koordinatensystem ein (auf Papier oder in dein Heft). Nutze die Wertetabelle aus a). Lies dann den Schnittpunkt S aus dem Graphen ab.</p><svg viewBox='0 0 280 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:320px;display:block;margin:10px auto;'><defs><marker id='ah18x' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='5' refX='5' refY='2.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,5 L7,2.5 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='100' y1='25' x2='100' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='150' y1='25' x2='150' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='200' y1='25' x2='200' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='250' y1='25' x2='250' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='150' x2='255' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='110' x2='255' y2='110' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='70' x2='255' y2='70' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='30' x2='255' y2='30' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='44' y1='190' x2='262' y2='190' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah18x)'/><line x1='50' y1='196' x2='50' y2='18' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah18x)'/><text x='50' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#777'>0</text><text x='100' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>20.000</text><text x='150' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>40.000</text><text x='200' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>60.000</text><text x='250' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>80.000</text><text x='46' y='153' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>5.000</text><text x='46' y='113' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>10.000</text><text x='46' y='73' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>15.000</text><text x='46' y='33' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>20.000</text><text x='266' y='194' font-size='11' fill='#555'>km</text><text x='54' y='16' font-size='11' fill='#555'>&euro;</text></svg><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:6px 0;'>Schnittpunkt S abgelesen:</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;'><span>S(&nbsp;x&nbsp;=</span><input class='cell-input' data-ans='50000' placeholder='?' style='width:80px;text-align:center;'><span>&nbsp;km,&nbsp; y&nbsp;=</span><input class='cell-input' data-ans='15000' placeholder='?' style='width:70px;text-align:center;'><span>&nbsp;&euro;&nbsp;)</span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgabe c) &ndash; Schnittpunkt rechnerisch</div><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>Berechne den Schnittpunkt rechnerisch (f(x) = g(x)). Ab wie viel Kilometern ist das E-Auto g&uuml;nstiger?</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>Ab&nbsp;x&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='50000' placeholder='?' style='width:90px;text-align:center;'>&nbsp;km</label><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(18)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(18)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-18'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:14px;line-height:2;'><strong>a) Wertetabelle:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;'>f: 5.000 &ndash; 9.000 &ndash; 15.000 &ndash; 21.000 &euro;</span><br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;'>g: 10.000 &ndash; 12.000 &ndash; 15.000 &ndash; 18.000 &euro;</span><br><br><strong>b) Graphen &ndash; Schnittpunkt S(50.000 | 15.000):</strong><br><svg viewBox='0 0 280 210' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' style='width:100%;max-width:300px;display:block;margin:8px auto;'><defs><marker id='ah18s' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='5' refX='5' refY='2.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L0,5 L7,2.5 z' fill='#555'/></marker></defs><line x1='100' y1='25' x2='100' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='150' y1='25' x2='150' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='200' y1='25' x2='200' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='250' y1='25' x2='250' y2='190' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='150' x2='255' y2='150' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='110' x2='255' y2='110' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='70' x2='255' y2='70' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='50' y1='30' x2='255' y2='30' stroke='#e5e7eb' stroke-width='0.7'/><line x1='175' y1='70' x2='175' y2='190' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-dasharray='4,3'/><line x1='50' y1='70' x2='175' y2='70' stroke='#dc2626' stroke-width='0.8' stroke-dasharray='4,3'/><line x1='44' y1='190' x2='262' y2='190' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah18s)'/><line x1='50' y1='196' x2='50' y2='18' stroke='#444' stroke-width='1.5' marker-end='url(#ah18s)'/><text x='50' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' fill='#777'>0</text><text x='100' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>20.000</text><text x='150' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>40.000</text><text x='200' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>60.000</text><text x='250' y='203' text-anchor='middle' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>80.000</text><text x='46' y='153' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>5.000</text><text x='46' y='113' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>10.000</text><text x='46' y='73' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='bold'>15.000</text><text x='46' y='33' text-anchor='end' font-size='7.5' fill='#777'>20.000</text><text x='266' y='194' font-size='11' fill='#555'>km</text><text x='54' y='16' font-size='11' fill='#555'>&euro;</text><line x1='50' y1='150' x2='250' y2='22' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='253' y='22' font-size='11' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='bold'>f</text><line x1='50' y1='110' x2='250' y2='46' stroke='#ea580c' stroke-width='2.5' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='253' y='46' font-size='11' fill='#ea580c' font-weight='bold'>g</text><circle cx='175' cy='70' r='5' fill='#dc2626' stroke='white' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='179' y='64' font-size='11' fill='#dc2626' font-weight='bold'>S(50.000|15.000)</text></svg><br><strong>c) Rechnerisch:</strong><br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;'>0,20x + 5000 = 0,10x + 10000<br>0,10x = 5000 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = <strong>50.000 km</strong></span><br>Beide Autos kosten dort genau 15.000 &euro;. Danach ist das E-Auto billiger.</div>"
